      "writtenOn": "2018-04-13T14:25:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "ec-devutils is the package that will install flash_ec on the host so you can flash the DUT.\nhttps://chromium.googlesource.com/chromiumos/overlays/chromiumos-overlay/+/master/chromeos-base/ec-devutils/ec-devutils-9999.ebuild#57\n\nYou can test this using:\n\nchroot$ cros_workon --host start chromeos-base/ec-devutils\nchroot$ emerge chromeos-base/ec-devutils\n\nchroot$ which flash_ec\n/usr/bin/flash_ec\n\nchroot$ which uartupdatetool\n/usr/bin/uartupdatetool\n\n\nThe flash_ec script uses the uartupdatetool: https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/master/util/flash_ec#919\n\nNot sure why the U is capitalized in the flash_ec script though.",
      "parentUuid": "4e6ab3e6_e2063e14",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 15,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 15,
        "endChar": 5
      },
